  "notes": "Geometric for «سميعا عليما» and «عفوا قديرا», hands for «تعفوا». 150-151 under a night sky with no motif; no motif on the messengers. Their words «نؤمن ببعض ونكفر ببعض» are not glossed as a statement; 150:6-11 and 150:17-22 frame them as a claim («يزعم», «إن هذا إلا مجرد أماني»). Al-Muyassar's first-person «وأعتدنا» not used. STAGING v4: 148-149: two men in a market; the camera shows the wrongdoer on 148:4; the wronged man speaks on 148:9 and points at the one who wronged him on 148:10 (both tafsirs allow the wronged to state his grievance); nothing is acted inside the conditional 149:1-9 (showing or hiding good, pardoning): only the camera on the wronged man and the hands plate on 149:7; geometric for the names. 150-151: a small group (3) of those who reject the messengers; they shake their heads on 150:2, speak on 150:12 (their claim, framed by the glosses) and shake their heads on 150:15; two-paths plate on 150:21 (the way in between); they stay on stage during 151 and nothing falls on them."
